            "body": {
              "type": "json",
              "data": "{}"
            }
          },
          "docs": "1) Validate the request and get the partner from it\n2) Verify if consumer exists and if so, if there's an onboarding flow\n3) Create a new onboarding (and new consumer) if needed\n4) Return the onboarding id and consumer data"
